<title>POLAND: NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 174 AT END-MARCH.</title>
<headline>NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 174 AT END-MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brokerages see mass privatisation National Investment Fund (NFI) units rising to 173.9 zlotys at the end of March and to 195.1 zlotys at the end of June, a poll in the daily Nowa Europa showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The units closed at 166.5 zlotys in regular bourse trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The brokerages' mid-year prediction was 2.2 percent higher than that made in February.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
